→ Pavé pick: **[East-West Sidestone + Pavé in 14k Rose Gold at $1,840](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-sidestone-and-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-1-4-ct-tw-item-192397?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** — east west + pavé fire + rose gold warmth.
