**Priority:** east west is a finger-shape decision first and foremost. Long/narrow fingers love east west — short/wide fingers suffer from it. Pick based on finger length-to-width ratio before you worry about metal, pavé, or carat. See the full [marquise cut diamond guide](/marquise-cut-diamond) for shape fundamentals.

