rquise-diamond-price">2ct guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5ct marquise</strong></td><td>~$3,283 lab</td><td>~$34,151 natural</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-sidestone-and-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-4-ct-tw-item-203349?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">East-West Sidestone + Pavé Platinum</a></td><td>$2,485</td><td>$5,768</td><td>Statement east west. See <a href="/2-5-carat-marquise-diamond-price">2.5ct guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

