ariant.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pavé platinum</strong></td><td>East-West Sidestone + Pavé</td><td>Platinum</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-sidestone-and-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-4-ct-tw-item-203349?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$2,485</a></td><td>Platinum pavé sidestone. Lifetime version.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Platinum classic (PLATINUM PICK, CEILING)</strong></td><td>East West Diamond Engagement Ring</td><td>Platinum</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-item-193952?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$2,600</a></td><td>Our platinum pick. Market ceiling. Substantial band + lifetime metal.</td></tr></tbody></table>

